WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
In a violet-lit futuristic city, an AI robot lands on a rooftop and accelerates into a sprint.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
The robot vaults a rooftop barrier, flips through the air, and lands in stride.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
The robot launches across a gap between skyscrapers toward a gold-lit office tower.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
It drops down the tower past a glowing sign reading “your company” and enters the office.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.041
The robot lands beside a desk, settles into the chair, and starts typing at a computer.
